      "caption": "Have you ever recited a verse and paused, wondering if you got the waqaf right? 🤔📖\n\nIntroducing TAJWID MASTERCLASS 3.0\nElevating Your Recitation: Advanced Rules and Waqaf\n\nTake your recitation beyond the basics, refine your precision, deepen your understanding of advanced tajwid rules, and recite with greater confidence and khusyu’.\n\n🗓️ Thursdays: 10, 17, 24 September & 1 October 2026\n🕢 Time: 7:30 PM – 9:30 PM\n📍 Venue: Classroom 2A, Level 3, Masjid Sultan Annexe Building\n\nWhether you’ve completed Masterclass 2.0 or simply want to sharpen your tajwid, this series is for you.\n\n📌 Limited seats — register now!\n🔗 bit.ly/mstajwid3\n\n#TajwidMasterclass #MasjidSultanSG #MenaraSultanSG"
    }
